2025-07-09-this-session-is-being-continued-from-a-previous-co.txt
# Blanket ignore for stray transcripts / dumps / quickref text files.
# CMakeLists.txt ENDS IN .txt, so it must be re-included explicitly --
# without this, every CMakeLists added after this rule landed is silently
# untracked (it already cost us tests/ and studio/, which made a fresh
# clone unable to build the unit suite or 2dfm-studio).
*.txt
!CMakeLists.txt
# ...but NOT the vendored source drops' own build files. We never
# add_subdirectory() any of them (see CMakeLists.txt:226 -- we compile
# their sources into our own targets), so tracking ~23 upstream
# CMakeLists we do not use would be noise.
vendored/**/CMakeLists.txt

